3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">4</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">blow out, extinguish,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τὴν λαμπάδα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1098</span> </span> (anap.), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ign.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">28</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">5</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">blow out, spurt</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">spout out,</b> <span class=\"gk\">φυσῶντ' ἄνω πρὸς ῥῖνας.. αἷμα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">918</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">6</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">blow</b> a wind instrument, <span class=\"gk\">φ. κόχλους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">303</span> </span>; also <span class=\"gk\">φυσᾶν</span> abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Av.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">859</span> </span>, cf. Epigr. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.337f</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φυσᾶντες</span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Boeot.</span> </span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">868</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χέρ' ἐφύση</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">blew into</b>.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <spa